{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "label": "BrokerActor (Basisklasse)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jedes Protokoll wird in einen Actor verpackt, der es hinter einem einheitlichen Vertrag verbirgt. Lifecycle, Buffering, Reconnect und Event-Publishing leben einmal in der Basisklasse; Subklassen besitzen nur die protokollspezifischen Teile."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_lifecycle_state_machine", "label": "Broker-Lifecycle-Zustandsautomat", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lineare Uebergaenge disconnected -> connecting -> connected -> disconnecting. Ein Fehler waehrend connected faellt nach disconnected und loest die Reconnect-Schleife aus; ein Stop laeuft aus jedem Zustand ueber disconnecting, damit es genau einen Aufraeumpfad gibt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_reconnect_with_backoff", "label": "Reconnect mit exponentiellem Backoff", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Jede Verzoegerung wird mit 1 +/- randomFactor gejittert (Default +/-20 %), damit eine Flotte von Broker-Actors, die denselben Broker gemeinsam verloren hat, nicht im Gleichschritt wiederholt. maxAttempts weggelassen heisst endlos."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_outbound_buffer", "label": "Outbound-Buffer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ausgehende Nachrichten schlagen bei getrennter Verbindung nicht sofort fehl, sondern werden begrenzt eingereiht. Bei Ueberlauf faellt die aelteste (FIFO) und ein BrokerBufferOverflow-Event wird publisht; outboundBuffer: 0 heisst Fail-Fast mit BrokerNotConnected."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_subscriber_fanout", "label": "Subscriber-Fan-out ueber withTarget", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Eingehende Protokollnachrichten gehen an eine vorab gesetzte Target-Ref. Die Subscription-Semantik unterscheidet sich pro Broker, das Muster bleibt gleich: Actor auf eine Ref richten, Protokollnachrichten als Actor-Nachrichten empfangen."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_settings_precedence", "label": "Settings-Praezedenz der Broker-Actors", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Konstruktor-Argument > HOCON unter einem protokollspezifischen Key > eingebaute Defaults. So lassen sich systemweite Defaults in application.conf setzen und pro Instanz ueberschreiben."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_lifecycle_events", "label": "Broker-Lifecycle-Events auf dem Event-Stream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Das Event-Payload traegt ueber actorPath, welcher Broker-Actor es ausgeloest hat, sodass ein einzelner Monitor alle Broker im System beobachten kann."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_subclass_hooks", "label": "Die drei Subklassen-Hooks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "connectImplementation, disconnectImplementation und dispatchOutgoing sind alles, was eine Subklasse implementiert; Zustandsuebergaenge, Buffering, Reconnect und Event-Publishing bleiben in der Basisklasse."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_kafkaactor", "label": "KafkaActor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_mqttactor", "label": "MqttActor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_not_a_broker_actor", "label": "Was kein Broker-Actor ist", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One-Shot-HTTP-Requests brauchen weder Reconnect noch Buffering, ein fetch() in onReceive ist die richtige Form. HTTP-Server sind ein eigenes Modul, weil sie nicht in die Form \"eine Verbindung, viele Nachrichten\" passen."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_lifecycle_state_machine", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_reconnect_with_backoff", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_outbound_buffer", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_subscriber_fanout", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_lifecycle_events", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_subclass_hooks", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_brokeractor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_settings_precedence", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_lifecycle_events", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_io_overview_broker_lifecycle_state_machine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/io/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src